/// `get_transcript` (road map "cut-by-transcript" CT-4, spec §11 TR-5,
/// TR-11): one clip's spoken words in TIMELINE ticks, fillers flagged — the
/// words File ▸ Generate Captions… and Clip ▸ Remove Filler Words… read,
